ngspice example decks — 'Modified BSD' license
==============================================

The decks in this directory are the example files distributed with ngspice.
ngspice's own COPYING states:

    The ngspice license is the `Modified BSD' license. This is adopted for
    all of its source code, test and example files except for the files
    listed below.

None of the listed exceptions (m4, tclspice.c, maths/sparse, maths/KLU,
osdi, ndev, xspice, frontend/numparam, the manual) are source files, so the
example decks vendored here fall under the Modified BSD terms reproduced
below verbatim from ngspice-46's COPYING.


